// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1780602589" "Hey everyone! A playmate! A PLAYMATE!!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2003310692" "Let's play!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1860203522" "Hey! Wait up for me!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2733015584" "Hey! Where're ya going? Don't leave!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1096782575" "Come back! Don't you wanna play with us?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2353942505" "Quit runnin'! I just want to make friends!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3241328287" "Why's it SO hard to make friends in this stupid place?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1957046630" "Boring, boring, BORING..."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1400803588" "Sure is lonely in this place."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1019081937" "If I don't make some new friends soon..."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1880920312" "Bored...<em>Bored...<em>Bored...<em>Bored...<em>BORED!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIRE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1908197108" "It's too dark and cold here..."

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1739441944" "Aha! Now's my chance!<em>Engage me!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2654415765" "Finally! Something POSITIVE in my life!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2463002348" "...another dilemma..."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1867463309" "So close this time..."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2061357583" "Finally! The missing piece to my puzzle!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1264449028" "...this one's about out of power too...always goes so quickly."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2487481650" "...almost depleted...they empty so fast."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2231517392" "I feel so...incomplete."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1712593320" "I could really use something, dare I say, POSITIVE ...in my life."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1016774165" "What's the point..?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LIGHTNING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2666218108" "Feelings are so fleeting...It's a wonder why I bother."

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_INFERNO_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2694058590" "LOOK! A combustable! Let's go and make some more friends!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_INFERNO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3201413321" "Remember, if ya see any combustables, be sure to let the group know!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_INFERNO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1944941914" "Say... you can see everything from here!<em>...And whatta DUMP!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_INFERNO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2562909947" "I think this one's about used up.<em>Wanna get a move on?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_INFERNO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3156876640" "Well, I think we have all the friends we can get outta this one. Let's head out!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_INFERNO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4126729019" "If everyone's made enough friends with this one, I saw another tree just around the corner."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_INFERNO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1766607473" "I spotted a Cloud of Ice heading this way a moment ago.<em>Maybe we better bail."

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2714482460" "Looks like we finally found some new friends in this dump!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2111620052" "Alright everyone, GROUP HUG!!<em>Bring it in, don't be shy!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3416315500" "This's gonna be FUN!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1917406046" "Looks like we found ourselves some more playmates!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2120253416" "Ready or not!<em>Here we come!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2824693082" "Why the big smiles? You friends got a game planned?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1023022244" "Sure they smile enough, but...<em>they don't seem all that friendly."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_BATTLE_DRUDGES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3197160558" "I'm not sure these things wanna play..."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FIGHT_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1603389059" "Sure 'ave."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_FIGHT_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2527657830" "Quite."

// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_BATTLE_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1599320773" "'Ang back there, Flick'rs and don't you worry none. This won't take t' long."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_BATTLE_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P963519806" "Ante-up boys! Looks like we'll be get'n our 'ands dir'y this night."
// NIGHTWARD_DRUDGES_BATTLE_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3773320316" "Aw, come now, li'l fellas... We wants t' play too!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1699922013" "Foolish spellthings!<em>You dare engage US in combat?"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_ANIMUS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2635844043" "Strike them down, sisters! Show these silly things the wrath of the Talons!"

// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_ANIMUS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4095992768" "Seize this distraction and snuff these spellthings out!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_ANIMUS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P990490348" "We'll not fall to such inferior beings!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_ANIMUS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1341427594" "You'll rue crossing us, spellthings!"
// NIGHTWARD_TOV_FIGHT_ANIMUS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P415697577" "We'll inflict pain so great you'll wish you had never been cast!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIGHT_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3074020936" "These creatures mean to snuff us out!<em>We mustn't give them the pleasure!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIGHT_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3697645778" "Alright, spellbrothers!<em>TO ARMS!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIGHT_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2353647794" "Hold your ground, spellbrothers!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIGHT_TOV_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3384744113" "Without our fear to arm them, these devils hold no power over us!<em>ATTACK!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIGHT_TOV_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1665571293" "They brought backup!<em>Spread out,spellbrothers!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIGHT_TOV_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2243583424" "Caution to the wind! It's eat or be eaten!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_FIGHT_TOV_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1169052868" "Muster your power, spellbrothers, and smite your enemies!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_DEAD_ENLIGHTEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1076997487" "I wish we could remain here always."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_DEAD_ENLIGHTEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4125683320" "How do you know so much about everything?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_DEAD_ENLIGHTEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1854431348" "You make me feel so young...so free."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_DEAD_ENLIGHTEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1836598410" "That's very interesting, please tell me more."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_DEAD_ENLIGHTEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4019989697" "Huh...I never thought of it that way."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_DEAD_ENLIGHTEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P742864513" "You're so insightful."

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046705497" "This realm is a curious one indeed!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P389928039" "Stay close, spellbrothers. The danger in this realm is great."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1969475337" "We are strangers in a strange land.<em>I'm not certain we belong here."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2985652243" "This place is wild and untamed...<em>We'd do well to explore with utmost vigilance."

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2554117199" "It's as I have forseen!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1489460072" "Caution to the wind!<em>It's eat or be eaten!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P686588839" "ALAS! The danger has come to US!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2089559493" "This is precisely what I have sought to evade."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2946745856" "Defend yourselves, spellbrothers! We must hold our ground."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4147211154" "Harm will not befall us if we stand together, spellbrothers!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_LOITER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P203895609" "Gather around, spellbrothers! Divided, we fall!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3467629681" "Aha! Found you, dear child!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2193906699" "Embrace me, my darling! Satiate my cold!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2452036366" "Leaving so soon?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3773348685" "You found me, my dear! Now bring me your heat!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P322942679" "Heat! Give it to me! I MUST have it!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3561572581" "Come closer! Close enough to hold, close enough TO FEEL!"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3009826177" "Come closer, dear child... your so... WARM!"

// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1145305362" "Let's see, now... Where, oh where did that ball of fire run of to..?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3445744222" "Oh, Fireball... Where have you gone to now..?"
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4101292382" "Only a ball of fire can melt this frozen heart of mine."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2718002449" "So cold... so... cold..."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3969300537" "I can still feel her... the warmth of her fire."
// NIGHTWARD_ANIMUS_ICE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1274228909" "Who's there? I can feel your warmth..."

